MySQLi for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module mysqli of php74-mysqli, the
same build, with php74-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php74-mysqlnd. The
same files as php74-mysqli: install one of the two.

The module mysqli of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its
headers in include/php74/php/ext/mysqli.
